SUMMARY:[Systems & Experimental Neuroscience][Computational Neuroscience] A
 READNE 2026 - Contributed talk/poster abstract submission deadline (cutof
 f time unannounced)
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: AREADNE: Research in Encoding and Decoding of
  Neural Ensembles\nWebsite: https://areadne.org/\nSource URL: https://are
 adne.org/\nLocation: Milos\, Greece\nTopics: Systems & Experimental Neuro
 science\, Computational Neuroscience\, BCI & Neurotechnology\nSize: S\nSu
 bmission type: Abstract-based\nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 
 2026-10-08\nNotes: Historical biennial meeting. June 23 is the welcome re
 ception\; scientific sessions follow. Proceedings are an abstract book\, 
 not archival full papers. Abstracts opened January 12\, 2026\; exact open
 ing and cutoff hours were not announced. Size is an editorial estimate.\n
 Scope: Encoding and decoding of neural ensembles\, with emphasis on syste
 ms neuroscience\, neural population recordings\, neural representations\,
  computation and links to behavior. It is a focused experimental/computat
 ional neuroscience meeting rather than a general neuroscience congress. C
 ontributions are reviewed abstracts for talks and posters\; its proceedin
 gs book is a collection of abstracts.\nAdditional topics: Cognitive Scien
 ce & Computational Cognition\nScope sources (2026): https://areadne.org/\
 nScope last checked: 2026-10-08\nOfficial deadline day\; exact cutoff hou
 r/timezone is unannounced. Verify the organizer's submission portal.
URL:https://areadne.org/
END:VEVENT
