 )
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: International Winter Conference on Brain-Comp
 uter Interface\nWebsite: https://brain.korea.ac.kr/bci2027/\nSource URL: 
 https://brain.korea.ac.kr/bci2026/authorinstructions.php\nLocation: Jeong
 seon\, South Korea\nTopics: BCI & Neurotechnology\, EEG/MEG & Neural Sign
 als\, Signal Processing\, Machine Learning\nSize: M\nSubmission type: Pap
 er-based\nConfidence: estimated\nLast checked date: 2026-10-08\nNotes: Co
 -organizer confirms February 22-24\, 2027 at High1 Resort\, Jeongseon. Th
 e 2027 deadline is unannounced\; December 15 is a one-year proxy from the
  final 2026 author instructions and CFP\, which supersede an older Octobe
 r date. Prior six-page papers use IEEE proceedings subject to IEEE qualit
 y review\; the 2027 publication details await the final CFP. The exact cu
 toff hour is unknown. Size is an editorial estimate.\nScope: Brain-comput
 er interfaces\, neural signal decoding\, multimodal brain measurements\, 
